                                                "sense_id": "b2c4c993-88fa-3673-b757-59e5ea0e3cd0",
                                                "text": "During the 1960s, anarcho-communists led the search for radical solutions to the historically novel problems facing young people. Above all, many people now wanted a say in the decisions which affected them."
